"r-87adu"><div data-rid="ad0802c1-06ea-4ede-ba01-1edd3e6eace6" class="r-nvda7w"></div><div data-rid="c3a07286-cb8d-4618-ba3d-5c9459acad5c" class="r-1y9o7hc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It’s too abstract for kids to care about</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="ee675dba-9633-4e51-8b98-e833293e7fc8" class="r-sd2y4"><div data-rid="095facf9-ee95-424f-b6b7-7f127a0f09ac" class="r-1cgenz4"></div><div data-rid="3a180f09-691c-4a90-8f95-0526cc789c75" class="r-10yc93f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Or it’s so simplified that nothing meaningful sticks</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="e442f261-0645-46ff-b8b0-dc4253f18e0a" class="r-empvs7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Tuttle Twins take a different approach.</p><p>Instead of lectures or textbooks, big ideas are taught through story.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a77d712b-b453-4a2e-b47f-4a8bb3abe4b6" class="r-zyodq2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your child follows relatable characters as they:</p></span></div><div data-rid="fccadac3-257f-470a-967e-70d92b677683" class="r-1v9uf84"><div data-rid="05d240fe-299e-4f9a-bdfc-bfac86bf7fa3" class="r-wvzzms"><picture data-rid="fa80b1dd-e38e-4c8e-8e24-ac336ee69e32" class="r-mnno7a"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/5de7c2d6-9d8d-45d3-ae11-5a674c5906b6?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/5de7c2d6-9d8d-45d3-ae11-5a674c5906b6?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/5de7c2d6-9d8d-45d3-ae11-5a674c5906b6?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/5de7c2d6-9d8d-45d3-ae11-5a674c5906b6" class="r-yaespe" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="71fabb18-415a-43e8-b6d2-392888dd8129"